==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|skemtiligr||amusing, interesting, pleasant}}, compare Old Norse {{m|non|óskemtiligr||dull, uninteresting}}, {{m|non|skemtiliga||amusingly, pleasantly}}, {{m|non|skemta||to amuse, to entertain}}, {{m|non|skemtan}} or {{m|non|skemtun||entertainment}} and {{m|non|skemtanligr||amusing, pleasant}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈskɛm̥tɪˌlɛːɣʏr/}}

===Adjective===
